  "source_read_notes": [
    "77031 retains all six entitlement gates; 77032 routes absence to Chapter 07; 77033 routes pensionable age to Chapter 74.",
    "77300 explicitly excludes special groups from normal-amount guidance; 77301 is the GC/SC/both distinction and cites two memos; 77350 retains dated SC and mixed-age restrictions.",
    "77302–77304 distinguish GC/SC inputs; 77330–77334 retain special-group routing, partner/no-partner standard amounts, exceptions, all listed additions and the complete historical example. Historical example amounts are not current rates.",
    "84001–84002 precede 84911 with actual/notional capital, ownership, disregards and valuation; selecting 84911 alone cannot establish a universal capital ceiling.",
    "85091–85092, 85100 and 85130 retain income lists, foreign-benefit treatment, exceptions and further retirement-income routes; 85171 retains both annuity exceptions and their explicit qualifications.",
    "77035 and 77140 concern distinct mixed-age definitions; their date qualifications, notes, statutory and memo references remain unresolved dependencies."
  ]
}
